      "insight": "Readers click L1 stories not for raw performance benchmarks but for financial primitive specialization — the signal is that stablecoin-native settlement, RWA custody, and Bitcoin-secured PoS attracted more engagement than any general-purpose EVM competitor, revealing an audience tracking which chain wins a specific institutional use case rather than which chain wins everything.",
